[[File:Basilisk Knight icon.png|left]]
The '''basilisk sentinel''' is a [[superior]] variant of the [[basilisk knight]]. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point|Slayer reward points]] from any [[Slayer master]]. Like their standard variant, a [[mirror shield]] or [[V's shield]] is required to safely engage them, as otherwise the player will take rapid damage and have their stats drained.

Along with its magic and melee attacks, it has a special attack in which it shoots a slower, pale-red coloured orb at the tile the player is currently standing on; if players do not move, this will encase them in stone, preventing players from attacking for a few seconds and displaying the message {{Mes|You have been entombed in stone!}}. This can be avoided while the orb is in flight by moving one square away, or by spam-clicking away to break free, similar to the fight against [[The Jormungand]]. When clicking away to break free, the message {{Mes|You feel the stone break slightly as you try to move.}} will be displayed. It will take four attempts to break free before succeeding, with success indicated by the message {{Mes|You manage to escape from the stone!|colour=Green}} . Failing to break out in time will result in a large amount of damage being inflicted, accompanied by the message {{Mes|The stone around you violently explodes!|colour=Red}} . While the special attack is easily avoidable, it can immediately kill players with moderate [[Hitpoints]] if they don't move in time. The special attack seems to have a cooldown of ~30 seconds beginning with the first attack, and is not guaranteed to be used immediately off cooldown.

